                                                "sense_id": "6f81fe8a-6c7b-392c-a882-66f701bccaa3",
                                                "text": "Toxicologists at the Taft Laboratory at the National Institute of Occupational Safety and Health (NIOSH) here are dosing mice with poppers to solve the baffling mystery of diseases which are killing gay men."
